          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In the heart of Egypt, Aswan beckons not just with its ancient wonders but also with a vibrant culinary scene. While many tourists delight in meals aboard Nile cruise boats, the onshore dining in Aswan offers an equally enchanting array of gastronomic experiences. Let’s embark on a journey through some of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000005"
              ],
              "text": "Aswan’s"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " most celebrated restaurants, where global flavors meet local charm."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/aswan-travel-guide/history-echoes/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/aswan/discover-aswan-history",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "King Jamaica Restaurant & Café"
